  "intro": {
    "text": "Mixed loanwords like *kitap* and *otobüs* follow their last vowel, as every word does: *kitaplar*, *otobüsler*. A few loanwords take *-ler* although their last vowel is back: *saat* → *saatler*, *harf* → *harfler*.",
    "see": "gp-harmony-exceptions"
  },
