      "points": ["gp-harmony-exceptions"],
      "question": "What is the plural of *saat* (clock)?",
      "options": ["saatler", "saatlar"],
      "optionsLang": "tr",
      "answer": 0,
      "why": {
        "1": "The last vowel is a, but *saat* is one of the few loanwords that take front suffixes."
      },
      "explain": "*saat* → *saatler*, like *harf* → *harfler*. Learn these few words as you meet them."
    },
    {
